    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12545" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dē-cŏrĭo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>,
				ātum, 1, v. a.
			corium, <i>to deprive of the skin</i> or
				<i>outer covering; to skin, to peel</i>
			(post-class., and very rare): <i><span class="en">Tert. Anim.
			33</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">amygdala decoriata,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. Jan. 15, 12</span></i>
			.</div>
